; The one variable: autowrap_mode = 2 (AUTOWRAP_WORD) on a box narrower than its label.
; Button, CheckBox, CheckButton, OptionButton and MenuButton wrap their label at the paragraph box
; (button.cpp:428-432) and cut each line to it (text_paragraph.cpp:925-931). CheckBox, CheckButton and
; MenuButton grow to the wrapped height. OptionButton sizes each item as one line (button.cpp:484-489),
; so its text overflows the box. Wrapping zeroes the text's width in the minimum size (button.cpp:493-495).

